{# THE SOURCE CARD. "How is the filing user going to remember the context of what
   happened?" By looking at it: the record this filing came from is pinned above
   the questions with its own words, its position in the same notation the source
   page prints, its time and its photographs. Nothing on it is editable —
   provenance is written once, at filing.

   Shared verbatim by both containers: it rides inside the drawer when the filing
   came from a record, and would ride at the head of the full page if one ever
   arrived there.

   Parameters: prefill, files
   ========================================================================== #}
<section class="i-src" data-incident-source-card>
    <div class="hd">{{ ux_icon('lucide:git-branch') }}<b>Filed from {{ prefill.label }}</b>
        {% if prefill.backUrl %}<a class="go" href="{{ prefill.backUrl }}">Open the source →</a>{% endif %}</div>
    {% if prefill.note %}<p class="note">“{{ prefill.note }}”</p>{% endif %}
    <div class="facts">
        {# `false` KEEPS THE MOMENT'S OWN ZONE. The observation was made at 08:15
           where the observer was standing, and a card meant to be recognised must
           not restate it in UTC. #}
        {% if prefill.occurredAt %}<span><em>when</em><b>{{ prefill.occurredAt|date('D j M Y · H:i', false)|lower }}</b></span>{% endif %}
        {% if prefill.positionLabel %}<span><em>where</em><b>{{ prefill.positionLabel }}</b></span>{% endif %}
        <span><em>source</em><b>{{ prefill.sourceLabel }}</b></span>
    </div>
    {# THE SOURCE RECORD'S PHOTOGRAPHS, through the cross-module seam.

       This bundle knows a record UUID and a source token and nothing else — it
       may not name the patrols module's classes, its routes or its key prefix,
       because a host may install either module without the other. So it asks the
       hub's registry, which asks the module that OWNS the record
       ({@see \UhifadhiLabs\Storage\Registry\FileRegistry::forRecord()}), and gets
       back the same FileEntry the Files hub gets.

       GRACEFUL WHEN THERE IS NOTHING. The storage bundle absent, the observation
       photographed by nobody, a token naming a module this deployment does not
       have — all three arrive here as an empty list, and the card simply has no
       strip. None of them is an error and none of them may cost anybody a report.

       THEY OPEN IN THE SHARED PREVIEW, the one component every surface opens a
       file in, so a photograph looks the same and says the same things whether it
       is opened from the Files hub, from its observation, or from here. #}
    {% if files is not empty %}
        {% import '@UhifadhiLabsStorage/overlay/_preview.html.twig' as preview %}
        {# A BUTTON, NOT A LINK, and the preview component is why: it reads a
           click inside an <a> as navigation and stands aside, so a thumbnail
           wrapped in one would leave the flow for a raw image file. `type=button`
           because this sits inside the report form and must never submit it. #}
        <div class="shots">
            {% for file in files %}
                <button type="button"
                        title="{{ file.name }}{% if file.takenAt %} · {{ file.takenAt|date('H:i') }}{% endif %}"
                        {{ preview.entry(file, '') }}>
                    <img src="{{ path('storage_evidence_show', {key: file.thumbKey ?? file.key}) }}"
                         alt="{{ file.name }}, from {{ prefill.label }}" loading="lazy">
                </button>
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
        {{ include('@UhifadhiLabsStorage/overlay/_preview.html.twig') }}
    {% endif %}

    <p class="seam">
        {%- if files is not empty -%}
            its {{ files|length }} photograph{{ 1 == files|length ? '' : 's' }}, category guess, coordinates, time and
            note are already in the form below · the link is kept forever
        {%- else -%}
            its category guess, coordinates, time and note are already in the form below · the link is kept forever
        {%- endif -%}
    </p>
</section>
